<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan-May global trade deficit 582 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan-May global trade deficit 582 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's global trade deficit fell to 582.5 billion escudos between January and May from 692.8 billion in same period last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>		   Jan-May 96  Jan-May 95    May 96   April 96</p>
<p> Overall balance  -582.5	-692.8     -117.9   -150.7</p>
<p> Imports	    2,117.7    2,107.0	435.8   434.6</p>
<p> Exports	    1,535.2    1,414.2	317.9    283.9</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of escudos. A minus sign denotes a deficit.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
